  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "cs_c",
      "defType": "meta/comment",
      "position": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": -314
      },
      "params": {
        "text": "Camera slit-scan\n\nThe Toggle opens the camera. Echo in `slit-scan` mode keeps the last 90 frames and builds the picture from all of them: the top row is now, each row lower is a frame older (`direction` turns it). Move your hand, or tilt your head, and it stretches into ribbons.\n\nUntil the camera is ready (or with none at all), Select shows a stand-in: a bar and two dots, rocked by one LFO and slid side to side by another, so the smear is there to see.",
        "width": 480,
        "height": 250
      },
      "portValues": {
        "text": "Camera slit-scan\n\nThe Toggle opens the camera. Echo in `slit-scan` mode keeps the last 90 frames and builds the picture from all of them: the top row is now, each row lower is a frame older (`direction` turns it). Move your hand, or tilt your head, and it stretches into ribbons.\n\nUntil the camera is ready (or with none at all), Select shows a stand-in: a bar and two dots, rocked by one LFO and slid side to side by another, so the smear is there to see.",
        "width": 480,
        "height": 250
      }
    },
